{"sections":[{"slug":"Kähler--Ricci曲率","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Kähler--Ricci曲率"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Kähler–Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Kähler–Ricci 曲率”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Kähler–Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">用</span> Futaki <span lang=\"zh\">老师的记号</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span>\n$$\r\nR_{i\\bar j} = g^{k \\bar \\ell} R_{i\\bar\\ell \\bar j k} = {{R_i}^k}_{\\bar j k} = - {R_{i\\bar j k}}^k = {R^k}_{ki\\bar j} \\in C^\\infty (\\operatorname{End}(E)\\otimes \\wedge^2 M).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">相比之下</span>, Riemann–Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">曲率为</span>\n$$\r\nR_{ij} = {{R_i}^k}_{jk}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">此时的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Bianchi恒等式","text":"Bianchi <span lang=\"zh\">恒等式</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n{{R_i}^k}_{\\bar j k} + {R_{i\\bar j k}}^k + {{R_{ik}}^k}_{\\bar j} = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$R_{i\\bar j}$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $g_{k\\bar\\ell}$ <span lang=\"zh\">及其导数表示</span>:\n$$\nR_{i\\bar j} = - g^{k\\bar\\ell} \\Big(\n\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial z^i \\partial \\bar z^j}</p>\n<ul>\n<li>g^{p\\bar q}\\frac{\\partial g_{k\\bar q}}{\\partial z^i}\\frac{\\partial g_{p\\bar \\ell}}{\\partial \\bar z^j}\\Big)= - \\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial z^i \\partial \\bar z^j}\\log\\det (g_{k\\bar\\ell}).$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与陈类的关系</span></h2>\n<p>$$\r\n\\sqrt{-1} R_{i\\bar j} dz^i \\wedge d\\bar z^j = \\sqrt{-1}\\operatorname{tr}R = 2\\pi c_1(M).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">流</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Ricci流","text":"Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">流</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的方程为</span>\n$$\r\n\\frac{\\partial g_{i\\bar j}}{\\partial  t} = - R_{i \\bar j}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}